Before you add the Call arm:
BinOp(+)
  Num(1)
  Unknown: Call(fn='max', args=[Num(value=2), BinOp(op='*', left=Num(value=3), right=Var(name='x'))])

Notice what went wrong: the whole Call SUBTREE vanished into one
'Unknown' line. The multiplication and the variable inside it were
never visited. A missing case does not raise; it silently truncates.

Now add the arm and rerun. Every node should appear.
